OL,3,GNEWSABuilding work begins on derelict
OL,4,Abrownfield site
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to build 77 council
OL,7,Fhomes on brownfield land in
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,10,FThe #15m project at Booth Street is on
OL,11,Fthe site of a former council yard, with
OL,12,Fthe wider area once the home of
OL,13,Ffactories and other industrial works.
OL,15,FThe project was given planning
OL,16,Fpermission in October 2025 and over the
OL,17,Fnext 18 months 57 flats and 20 houses
OL,18,Fwill be built for rental.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
