OL,3,GNEWSABuilding work begins on derelict
OL,4,Abrownfield site
OL,5,
OL,6,FStoke-on-Trent City Council said the
OL,7,Fdevelopment would help meet growing
OL,8,Fdemand for affordable housing across
OL,9,Fthe city.
